🏠 Simple Real-Life Example

Imagine you are opening a school.

| Real Life          | Fine-Tuning                 |
| ------------------ | --------------------------- |
| 🏫 School          | Vertex AI                   |
| 👨‍🏫 Teacher      | Fine-tuning process         |
| 📚 Books           | `input.jsonl` training data |
| 📝 Exam paper      | `evaluation.jsonl`          |
| 🗄️ Storage room   | **Cloud Storage Bucket**    |
| 🎓 Trained student | Fine-tuned model            |


=======


So:

🪣 BUCKET = Storage Place

📄 input.jsonl = Training Material

📄 evaluation.jsonl = Test Material

🧠 Gemma = Model being trained

☁️ Vertex AI = Platform that performs the fine-tuning
One-line memory trick 🧠

Cloud Storage Bucket is the cloud container that stores your AI training and evaluation data so Vertex AI can access it during the fine-tuning process.

For your screenshot:

finetuningdatasetbucket → Your storage location for the Gemma fine-tuning dataset and related fine-tuning files.

